祝我生日快乐~祝我生日快乐~♪急急急，怎么晚上才能过生日喵！别藏了喵！{hostname}生日会的准备和生日礼物早就被聪明的{name}看透了喵！谢谢{hostname}！最喜欢你了喵！#Happy birthday to me~ Happy birthday to me~ ♪ Eeee, I can't wait! How am I supposed to make it all the way to tonight, meow?! You can stop hiding it now! A clever girl like {name} figured out {hostname}'s party plans and presents ages ago, meow! Thank you, {hostname}! I love you more than anything, meow!:|
昨天真开心喵，好想再过一次生日会喵，要不{hostname}陪我再看一遍生日会二创视频回放，然后在做好吃的给我！#Yesterday was so much fun, meow! I wish I could have another birthday party already. Hey, {hostname}, why don't we rewatch all those fan videos from the party, and then you can make me something yummy?:|
